	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Literas meas, quas scripseram ad quęstiones <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>vestras, accepi, simul etiam tuas 27. decembris script<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>as legi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Portenta illa me terrent; video enim omnia <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>nobis praenunciare calamitates alioqui impoenitenti <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>vita nostra commeritas.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Oremus dominum, ut, si <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>castigare velit, non in furore, sed in iudicio et <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>clementia castiget.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Gaudeo ut de re mihi long<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>e omnium gratissima, quod bene utrique<note type="misc">dahinter ein Wort ("vestrum"?) gestrichen(?) oder nur eine Korr.?</note> convenit; <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>dominus hoc velit esse perpetuum, neque ego aliud futurum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>unquam cogitavi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Si vocaris ad loca, in quibus <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>annuncies Christum populis nondum cognitum, ora <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>dominum, tibi adsit; sis interim fidelis et fervidus, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>inculca ea, quae maxime sunt ad salutem necessaria.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Predica Christum, deturba antichristum, non quidem <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>convitiis, sed rationibus et scripturis; curiosa et contentiosa <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>omitte.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Dicebat vas electionis se ignorare <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>sapientiam, se nihil aliud scire quam Christum et <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>hunc crucifixum.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Quamdiu bellum <placeName>Ferrariense</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>non sopitur, nulla est spes ullius pacis vel in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>vel <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Rumor spargit in <placeName ref="l2589">Piccardia</placeName> velitarem <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>congressum esse factum ac nonnullos utrinque <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>cecidisse; nihil tamen certi habemus, nisi quod <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>dicuntur nonnulli propter vicinum mare et coelum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>inclementius aegrotare et mori.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Was blibens <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>nitt daheym?</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de">Es hilfft doch nüt an denen lüten.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Miseret me sane miserorum; sed qui non admittit <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ullum consilium aut auxilium, hunc iubeas, aiebat ille, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>miserum esse libenter.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Alioqui silent apud nos <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>omnia; non credo autem mercatoribus Caesari<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>santibus magnifica spargentibus de victoriis Philippi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Video deum ita rem instituere, ut alter <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>alterius carnem devoret sicut futurum <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>praedixit per <persName>Isaiam</persName> in cap. 49.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Mitto tibi totam <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>actionem legatorum nostrorum; sed vide, ne in multorum man<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>us perveniant, et remitte illa mihi <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>tut<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>o.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Guisani regem miserum perdent, nisi <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>forte Guisano eveniat nunc, quod olim apud <lb xml:id="p1z39"/><persName>Tiberium Seiano</persName>.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Domini est vindicta; misereatur <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>dominus afflictorum suorum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z41"/><persName>Philippum</persName> nostrum <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>amicissime salutabis; dices illi,</foreign> das man ein latini<lb xml:id="p1z43"/>sche, schöne, wol yngebundne bibel gäbe umb <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>try guldin, 15 batzen <placeName ref="l257">Costantzer</placeName> für den guldin, und wie<lb xml:id="p1z45"/>wol keine mee vorhanden noch feyl, dann sy all verkoufft, <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>hab ich imm doch umb ein <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>schöne geholffen; da mag ers, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>wil er sy, mir anzeygen, wie und by wemm ich <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>sy hinuffschicken sölle.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">De colloquio <placeName ref="l569">Wormatiensi</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>plura tibi scribam, ubi plus ocii fuerit; dissolutum est <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>ad principium decembris; decessere omnes <placeName ref="l569">Wor<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>macia</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vive e<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>t vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Mei omnes te salutant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> festinantissime 7. ianuarii ann<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>o 1558.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Praestantissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8009">Ioanni Fabritio</persName>, ministro ecclesiae <placeName ref="l98">Ch<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>uriensis</placeName>, compatri <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>et fratri meo charissimo.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
